  "details": "I often get messages from people asking why they were banned from my group, and unless I have a notepad or something else to track the ban reasons i will probably forget. It will be awesome if vrchat could include a ban reason to groups, visible in the ban notification for the player and stored on the bans tab for moderators.\n\nAnother thing I want to ask for is Timeouts. They will work disabling player ability to join group instances for a determined time, this will be specially useful in club groups where you want to send a timeout to a player that, for example, opened a portal in the middle of your dance floor. While this act constitutes a ban, you probably don't want that player permabanned maybe you want it not joining for the rest of the night or a few days.",
